      "$schema": "metaschema.yaml",
      "name": "TAPP Composition Module: LaserAblation",
      "abstract": "The shared LaserAblation block of the 2026-08-11 TAPP library, composed by 6 of the sixteen delivery tables. 18 owned fields over 17 schema paths, split into the procedure and analysis halves a TAPP schema and a technique detail compose respectively. A profile over existing tappDefinition/adaProduct properties, not a new vocabulary. Generated from the module CSV and its schema-path sidecar.",
