      "name": "FIB-SEM Technique-Aligned Protocol Profile (semFibsemTAPP)",
      "abstract": "Focused-ion-beam SEM (FIB-SEM tomography, TEM lamella prep) extension of the base TAPP definition. Basic protocol-tier fields are required top-level ada: properties; Advanced protocol-tier fields are schema:additionalProperty[] entries. No ada:analyteTemplate. Generated from docs/SEM_FIBSEM_TAPP_v4.xlsx by tools/build_tapp.py.",
